    "section_rich_text_xykVd9": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Yq6GFy": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Full Home Interior Design Project | Leicester",
            "text_size": 4,
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_Wc4Vwb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This residential interior design project on London Road in Leicester involved transforming a period home into a refined and cohesive living space inspired by the elegance of a classic London townhouse.</p><p>While the architectural bones of the property and kitchen were already in place, the client wanted a fully considered interior that balanced modern comfort with timeless character, while still respecting the home's existing period features.</p><p>Working closely with the client, we delivered a tailored interior design package focused on space planning, furniture layout and full sourcing to bring the home together in a cohesive and liveable way.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "heading_deKB9A": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "A Fast Turnaround Project",
            "text_size": 3,
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_JLr7JP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The design process started in October, with the goal of completing the home before Christmas.</p><p>This required a fast and collaborative approach, working closely with our trusted network of local trades and suppliers in Leicester to coordinate deliveries, installations and final styling.</p><p>Alongside the design work, we also supported the client with project management and supplier coordination to ensure the home was ready on schedule.</p><p>Spaces Designed: Entrance hallway, Formal lounge, Open plan living and dining area, Stairway and landing, Master bedroom, Two guest bedrooms. </p><p></p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Yq6GFy",
